{"reviewId": "37324968_83Xk7kWbC", "review": {"abstract": "美元仍是最核心的国际货币，是大宗商品与黄金的定价货币", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "chapterUid": 14, "content": "从目前的情况来看，美元与黄金的关系已慢慢开始脱离。当前的黄金疯涨，更在另一层面说明了美元的信用不断下降，全球避险心理空前，连央行也纷纷增持黄金。加之近来的联邦政府“停摆”，更是加剧了这一现象。所以美元体系是崩溃到底？还是触底反弹重领风骚呢？别急，让我们把心态放好，与时间和平相处，终会作为答案的见证人与参与者。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "5693-5719", "createTime": 1760655334, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 14, "reviewId": "37324968_83Xk7kWbC", "userVid": 37324968, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "author": {"userVid": 37324968, "name": "杨不知", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/b79dDWEichFBYLeOuPaawqiaANTjC5eMMpwgZRbs0QNib2ESIM1PsrQ41ibanqVvpPQ9ZcEbO8Rvjl7U4kEYicfPqIuFasoqWhv3Z23dzlnOd9mQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "杨不知", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "热爱生活，积极向上，便是全部！", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "但行好事，莫问前程", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 4, "likes": [{"userVid": 83339551, "name": "Terry Blunt", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/AxcvTqicb8yKwTFd9Ciahu2wGOLbs5r9QAAMyXsgADRx3cNsIXQt8F58ibgZYysC7GqIFCnHBu8sfo/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M11-0-50", "desc": "点评书籍", "titl